      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "About a four out of ten. It's once or twice a day. I've, I've had an ache in my wrist too, for six months. As for ache in my wrist, mostly severe. And I've been waking at night with my hand numb as well.",
